{"id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-ergodic.md","title":"Ergodic","display":"df-ergodic — Ergodic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ergodic","aliases":["58-df-ergodic"],"display":"df-ergodic — Ergodic","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ergodic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ergodic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ergodic — Ergodic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (ergodic predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (mod-null ergodicity alias defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ergodic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ergodic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ergodicity: no proper invariant measurable sets</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in L^1(X,\\mathcal{F},\\mu)\">\\(f\\in L^1(X,\\mathcal{F},\\mu)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ T=f\">\\(f\\circ T=f\\)</span>, then ergodicity implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is almost everywhere constant.</li>\n<li>Birkhoff: time average = space average a.e.</li>\n<li>Mixing implies ergodicity</li>\n<li>Unique ergodicity: uniform convergence</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Einsiedler and Ward, Ergodic Theory with a View Towards Number Theory</li>\n<li>Petersen, Ergodic Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (ergodic predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ergodic} \\vdash \\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in L^1(X,\\mathcal{F},\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\circ T=f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1030,"backlinks":[{"id":"8160ac3d14bcbf65","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82c5bdbca91dff27","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S$ (see [[58-df-measure-space]]), $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-function]]), and $\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S$ (see [[58-df-ergodic]])"},{"id":"549905599c0c8f9c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)$（遍历保测变换谓词，见 [[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]]）"},{"id":"180fc7511460425a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]])"},{"id":"2751a859d290ac09","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9KolmogorovSinaiEntropy}_S$ are the predicates from [[58-df-ergodic]] and [[58-df-zfc-measure9-kolmogorov-sinai-entropy]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md|58-df-ergodic]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["785c80475c01fc69"]}